# An unreleased game's page never lives in this repository. There is one block
# below per game whose `released` switch is off, listing the same pieces in the
# same order, and the whole block comes out on the day that switch goes on, or
# on the day its `page_unlisted` switch publishes the page ahead of the game.
# `_games/<name>.md` is tracked either way: it holds only front matter, the
# banner words the home page already shows in public.

